  "nativeMeasurement": {
    "method": "Opened all eleven original public pages, inspected native full BODY and source-cell diagnostic zooms, selected independent right/left apertures and weapon enclosures. Preserved all admitted rects, pivots and fixed page BODY references. No pixel transforms in production assets.",
